{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2022-01-06 19:00:00', 'title': 'C5 ACQUISITION CORPORATION ANNOUNCES PRICING OF $250 MILLION INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING', 'text': 'WASHINGTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--C5 ACQUISITION CORPORATION (THE “COMPANY”), A SPECIAL PURPOSE ACQUISITION COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF ITS INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING (“IPO”) OF 25,000,000 UNITS AT A PRICE OF $10.00 PER UNIT. THE UNITS WILL BE LISTED ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE (“NYSE”) AND WILL TRADE UNDER THE TICKER SYMBOL “CXAC.U” BEGINNING JANUARY 7, 2022. THE COMPANY IS LED BY CEO ROBERT MEYERSON, FORMER PRESIDENT OF BLUE ORIGIN. STEVE DEMETRIOU, CHAIR AND CEO OF JACOBS ENGINEERING (NYSE:'}